iv class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Removed</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Wooden Saw</b> was a saw that new players were supposed to recieve at the start of the game. It was supposed to be worst saw in the game, being also sold at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>.\n</p><p>Saws are tools used to cut off the bark of trees, increasing their price.\n</p><p>This saw was removed very early on in development due to being unneeded, as it barely had any significant stat differences compared to the <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Saw\" title=\"Rusty Saw\">Rusty Saw</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p><b>Wooden Saw</b>, like the name implies, is a typical looking saw made entirely out of wood. \n</p><p>It's handle is made out of yellowish brown wood. Blade is yellow in color with the same material applied to it.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This tool is a part of the group of removed starter tools. Those being the <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Axe\" title=\"Wooden Axe\">Wooden Axe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Chisel\" title=\"Wooden Chisel\">Wooden Chisel</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Pickaxe\" title=\"Wooden Pickaxe\">Wooden Pickaxe</a>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902213012\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040